{"seq":2,"slug":"ctr-cvr-attribution","title":"CTR/CVR 与归因窗口/位置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/search-funnel-metrics/ctr-cvr-attribution","wordCount":2660,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"ctr-cvr-与归因窗口-位置\">CTR/CVR 与归因窗口/位置</h1><p>一家平台把排序模型换掉之后，搜索 CTR 从 18.2% 涨到 21.4%，团队准备灰度到全量。同一天，搜索带来的 GMV 下降了 6%。两个数字都是真的：新模型把高点击率的低价商品排到了前面，用户点得更多、买得更少。这件事说明 CTR 与 CVR 不是「质量指标」而是<strong>代理指标</strong>，它们的值取决于分母定义、归因窗口和位置构成这三个与模型质量无关的变量。本文把这三个变量拆开，给出可复现的处理方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-比率指标的三个隐藏参数\">核心概念：比率指标的三个隐藏参数</h2><p>CTR 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CTR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>clicks</mtext><mtext>impressions</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CTR} = \\frac{\\text{clicks}}{\\text{impressions}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CTR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3612em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">impressions</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">clicks</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是完整的数学，但它缺三个参数，任何一个变化都会改变结论。</p>\n<p><strong>分母参数</strong>：一次曝光是「服务端返回了一条结果」还是「客户端确认用户看到了这一条」？前者会把用户从未滚动到的结果计入分母。在一个一屏显示 4 条、用户平均滚动 1.5 屏的移动端列表里，服务端口径的分母可能是客户端口径的 2.5 倍——同一个系统同一批行为，CTR 从 4% 变 10%。因此对比两个渠道或两个市场时，先确认分母口径一致，这一步比看数字本身重要。</p>\n<p><strong>窗口参数</strong>：成交发生在点击之后多久仍归属于该点击？1 小时/24 小时/7 天/30 天四个窗口在搜索场景下的差异非常大，因为搜索行为的决策周期本身跨度大——买数据线是一小时，买手机是一周。窗口越长 CVR 越高，且长窗口会把「浏览渠道」的功劳系统性地划给「最后一次搜索」。</p>\n<p><strong>位置参数</strong>：同一批商品换一个排序位置，CTR 会变。位置偏差（position bias）意味着「CTR 涨了」可能是「商品被排得更靠前了」，与相关性改善无关。</p>\n<p>三者相乘的后果是：一个只报 CTR 的看板无法区分「模型更懂用户」和「模型更爱把热门商品前置」。区分它们是工程任务，不是分析技巧。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>常见取值</th>\n<th>对 CTR 的方向</th>\n<th>对 CVR 的方向</th>\n<th>工程处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>曝光分母</td>\n<td>服务端返回 / 视口确认</td>\n<td>服务端口径显著更低</td>\n<td>同向</td>\n<td>统一为视口确认，两口径并存但不混用于对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归因窗口</td>\n<td>1h / 24h / 7d / 30d</td>\n<td>不直接影响</td>\n<td>窗口越长越高</td>\n<td>主口径 + 敏感性分析并列展示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置构成</td>\n<td>首位 / 前 10 / 全列表</td>\n<td>位置越靠前越高</td>\n<td>复杂</td>\n<td>位置分层 + 反事实校正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品构成</td>\n<td>新品占比 / 价格带</td>\n<td>混合影响</td>\n<td>混合影响</td>\n<td>分层或标准化后再比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"位置偏差的识别与校正\">位置偏差的识别与校正</h2><p>位置偏差的传统识别方法是在线随机化：以一个小概率（例如 1%）把结果列表<strong>随机打散</strong>，对比随机化流量与正常流量上同一商品在同一位置的点击率。这类实验给出的是位置对点击的因果效应，代价是损失一部分用户体验，因此只在小流量、短周期上运行。</p>\n<p>更常用的做法是基于日志的反事实校正，核心假设是<strong>位置对点击的影响可以用一个与商品无关的乘子近似</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>click</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{click} \\mid i, p) = \\sigma\\!\\left(\\gamma_p \\cdot r_i\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">click</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是商品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的相关性得分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的偏好乘子。这个假设被称为「位置偏好模型」或「检验偏差模型」的简化形式——「点击 = 用户检验了该结果 且 认为它相关」这一检验假设（examination hypothesis）由 Joachims 等人在 2005 年提出，其中检验概率随排名下降，因此原始点击数反映的是位置偏差而非单纯相关性（来源：Joachims et al., &quot;Accurately Interpreting Clickthrough Data as Implicit Feedback&quot;, SIGIR 2005, <a href=\"https://www.cs.cornell.edu/people/tj/publications/joachims_etal_05a.pdf\">https://www.cs.cornell.edu/people/tj/publications/joachims_etal_05a.pdf</a>）；它在很多公开数据集上被验证过（微软与雅虎发布的搜索日志数据集是这一领域的标准基准——微软的 MSLR-WEB30K/WEB10K 于 2010 年发布，含 136 维特征与 0-4 级相关性标注；来源：Microsoft Learning to Rank Datasets, <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/project/mslr/\">https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/project/mslr/</a>），但它在<strong>移动端瀑布流</strong>上比在传统十蓝链页面上更不可靠——因为瀑布流的位置与内容的视觉吸引力高度耦合，一个带视频的商品放在第 5 位可能比一个纯图商品放在第 2 位更吸引点击。实践中通常做位置分桶（1、2-3、4-10、11+）而不是逐位置估计，牺牲分辨率换稳健性。</p>\n<p>有了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就可以定义校正后的 CTR：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CTR</mtext><mtext>adj</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi></munder><msub><mtext>clicks</mtext><mi>p</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi></munder><msub><mtext>imp</mtext><mi>p</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CTR}_{\\text{adj}} = \\frac{\\sum_{p}\\text{clicks}_p / \\gamma_p}{\\sum_{p}\\text{imp}_p / \\gamma_p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CTR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6976em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5758em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">imp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clicks</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的含义是「假设所有商品都排在同一位置上时的点击率」。这个指标适合用来跨时间比较排序系统的变化，<strong>不适合</strong>对外汇报——因为它不对应任何用户真实体验到的数字。报表上应当同时给出原始 CTR 与校正 CTR，当两者方向不一致时（原始涨、校正跌），警报立刻响：这说明变化来自位置重分配而非相关性改进。上面提到的那次排序模型上线，就属于这种情况。</p>\n<p>位置分桶的边界必须稳定。如果某次改版把前 10 位的结果数从 10 改成 12，分桶边界不调整会让 11-12 位的新商品落入「11+」桶，拉低该桶均值并造成伪回归。因此位置分桶定义要写入数据字典并与前端结果页版本绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因窗口的选择与多触点语气\">归因窗口的选择与多触点语气</h2><p>窗口选择没有唯一正确答案，但有正确的做法：<strong>主口径固定 + 敏感性分析</strong>。</p>\n<p>主口径的选择依据业务节奏。快消、3C 配件类平台常用 1 天或 7 天；家居、大家电需要 7 天到 30 天。选择原则是让窗口覆盖「大多数成交的决策时长」，可用数据验证：统计点击到成交的时间分布，取累计 80% 分位作为窗口候选。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH intervals AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    c.market,&#10;    DATE_DIFF(&#39;hour&#39;, c.event_time, o.paid_at) AS lag_hours&#10;  FROM search_click_events c&#10;  JOIN order_items o&#10;    ON o.search_request_id = c.request_id&#10;   AND o.item_id = c.item_id&#10;  WHERE o.paid_at &gt;= c.event_time&#10;    AND DATE_DIFF(&#39;day&#39;, c.event_time, o.paid_at) &lt;= 30&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  market,&#10;  APPROX_QUANTILE(lag_hours, 0.5)  AS p50_hours,&#10;  APPROX_QUANTILE(lag_hours, 0.8)  AS p80_hours,&#10;  APPROX_QUANTILE(lag_hours, 0.95) AS p95_hours&#10;FROM intervals&#10;GROUP BY market;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intervals </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DATE_DIFF(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hour'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lag_hours</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_click_events c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_items o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">search_request_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">request_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DATE_DIFF(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  APPROX_QUANTILE(lag_hours, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p50_hours,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  APPROX_QUANTILE(lag_hours, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p80_hours,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  APPROX_QUANTILE(lag_hours, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95_hours</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intervals</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>按市场分别看这个分布是必要的：同一平台在德国与印尼的 <code>p80_hours</code> 可能相差三倍，用统一窗口会让一个市场系统性高估、另一个低估。这份分布也是 <a href=\"../query-product-insights/per-market-compare\">分市场/语言对比看板</a> 里「可比性」的前置条件之一。</p>\n<p>窗口定了之后还有<strong>归因方式</strong>的问题。搜索很少是唯一的触点：用户可能先搜索、再加购、再通过推送回来下单。常见的三种归因是末次点击（last click）、首次点击（first click）、线性分摊（linear）。搜索在末次点击口径下会系统性吃亏、在首次点击口径下系统性占便宜。多数电商平台采用折中：<strong>同一会话内按搜索归因，跨会话按末次归因</strong>，并且在报表上明确标注。不要把口径当成可以自由选择的便利工具——同一张报表内混用两种归因是数据团队最容易犯且最难被发现的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把-ctr-cvr-变成可信判决\">把 CTR/CVR 变成可信判决</h2><p>三个参数都处理完，还需要一组约束让指标能承担判决责任。</p>\n<p><strong>配对使用时给方向性</strong>。CTR 单独升高不构成上线理由，需要同时看 CVR、加购率与单位曝光 GMV。正常的相关性改进会让 CTR 与 CVR 同向或至少不冲突；如果 CTR 涨而 CVR 显著跌，第一嫌疑是「前置了高点击低转化商品」，第二嫌疑是曝光口径变化，第三嫌疑是归因窗口被改动。这个三元排查顺序能覆盖绝大多数异常。</p>\n<p><strong>分层报告代替总体平均</strong>。总体 CTR 是各分层的加权平均，权重（流量构成）变了也会让总体动。因此搜索看板的基础粒度应该至少包含类目 × 设备 × 新老用户三层，总体数字只作为索引。这是<strong>辛普森悖论</strong>在搜索分析里的标准形态——「某趋势在若干分组中都出现，但合并后消失或反转」即辛普森悖论，经典的肾结石治疗例子中 A 疗法在每个结石尺寸分组上都优于 B，合并后反而显得更差，混杂变量是结石尺寸（来源：Simpson&#39;s paradox, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simpson%27s_paradox\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simpson%27s_paradox</a>）：某个类目在每个设备上都变差了，但因为变差的类目是低 CTR 类目而它的流量占比下降，总体 CTR 反而上升。</p>\n<p><strong>指标噪声要可见</strong>。CTR 在长尾查询上极不稳定——一个只有 3 次曝光的查询，CTR 只能是 0%、33%、67% 或 100%。任何按查询排序的「CTR 排行」如果不过滤最小样本量，榜首一定是「1 次曝光 1 次点击」的噪声查询。工程做法是在聚合层强制 <code>impressions &gt;= N</code>（常见取 100 或 200），并把被过滤掉的查询占比作为一个数据质量指标上报。这一点在 <a href=\"../query-product-insights/query-demand-analysis\">查询需求/缺口/趋势分析</a> 里会再次出现，因为需求分析的两端都是长尾。</p>\n<p>最后，CTR/CVR 的定义必须与实验度量一致。搜索 A/B 的显著性判定、方差缩减与替代评估方法见 <a href=\"../experiment-feedback/search-ab-metrics\">搜索 A/B 的指标与显著性</a>——那里会说明为什么位置偏差校正后的指标在小流量实验中比原始 CTR 更容易通过显著性检验，以及为什么这不是「放宽标准」而是「去掉噪声」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CTR/CVR 是代理指标：分母、窗口、位置三个隐藏参数任一变化都会改变结论，与模型质量无关。</li>\n<li>曝光分母统一为视口确认；服务端口径可用于覆盖率诊断，不可用于跨渠道对比。</li>\n<li>位置偏差要么靠小流量随机化实测，要么靠位置偏好模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 校正；校正后的 CTR 用于内部比较，不对外汇报。</li>\n<li>归因窗口按市场分别用点击-成交时延分布的 80% 分位确定；主口径固定，敏感性分析并列。</li>\n<li>分层报告优先于总体平均，否则辛普森悖论会让「总体变好、每一层都变差」的情况静默通过。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[CTR 变化] --&gt; B{分母口径变了吗}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| B1[重算同口径后比较]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C{位置构成变了吗}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| C1[看校正 CTR 方向]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D{窗口或归因变了吗}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| D1[回到主口径重跑]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[真实相关性变化]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|原始涨 校正跌| F[位置重分配 非相关性改进]&#10;    E --&gt; G[再看 CVR 与 GMV 是否同向]\">graph TD\n    A[CTR 变化] --&gt; B{分母口径变了吗}\n    B --&gt;|是| B1[重算同口径后比较]\n    B --&gt;|否| C{位置构成变了吗}\n    C --&gt;|是| C1[看校正 CTR 方向]\n    C --&gt;|否| D{窗口或归因变了吗}\n    D --&gt;|是| D1[回到主口径重跑]\n    D --&gt;|否| E[真实相关性变化]\n    C1 --&gt;|原始涨 校正跌| F[位置重分配 非相关性改进]\n    E --&gt; G[再看 CVR 与 GMV 是否同向]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CTR/CVR 与归因窗口/位置","id":"ctr-cvr-与归因窗口-位置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：比率指标的三个隐藏参数","id":"核心概念-比率指标的三个隐藏参数"},{"level":2,"text":"位置偏差的识别与校正","id":"位置偏差的识别与校正"},{"level":2,"text":"归因窗口的选择与多触点语气","id":"归因窗口的选择与多触点语气"},{"level":2,"text":"把 CTR/CVR 变成可信判决","id":"把-ctr-cvr-变成可信判决"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"曝光-点击-加购-成交漏斗口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/search-funnel-metrics/impression-click-conversion"},"next":{"title":"零结果率与搜索退出率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/search-funnel-metrics/zero-result-exit-rate"}}